[6:00p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate 

Traffic moving out of VI is on the high side at the moment, as motorists throng out of the Island.

- Ozumba Mbadiwe is slow from Kofo Abayomi inwards Law School, also quite slow from The Lagoon inward Bony Camp;
- Adeola Odeku is slow inwards Ahmadu Bello Way intersection;
- Slow on Ahmadu Bello way inwards Adeola Odeku intersection;
- Trafic is slow inwards Eko Hotel Roundabout;
- Akin Adesola is slow inwards Alfred Rewane.
- Adetokunboh Ademola is good
- Ajose Adeogun is good.

